                -> Exchange Receive dop )
                    -> Exchange Send dop )
                        -> Filter: (t1.a > 1)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Table scan on t1  (cost=*** rows=***)
            -> Stream results
                -> Exchange Receive dop )
                    -> Exchange Send dop )
                        -> Filter: (t3.a between 1 and 9)  (cost=*** rows=***)
                            -> Index range scan on t3 using PRIMARY  (cost=*** rows=***)

